  characterName: Noto Maya
  description: Formerly Kihara Maya. Somehow, after all their fights, she married
    Noto Hisamitsu and had a child. Their life together has been anything but smooth,
    but there's just enough love for it to last. She's now carrying a second child,
    a girl. She had gone years without speaking to Nanako, too.
